  "title": "India's Largest IPO in Jio Platforms and Global IPOs",
  "summary": "Jio Platforms raised up to $3.2 billion in India's largest IPO with shares selling at record prices and second largest in dollar terms, representing a significant investment in its expansion beyond traditional telecom services. This represents a significant investment in Jio's global expansion.",
